<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 5.94 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 5.94 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 5.94 percent in the week ending August 31 from 5.71 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES	 Aug 31	Aug 24	Sept 2, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +5.94	  +5.71	  +8.65</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  314.1	  313.1	  296.5</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended September 2, 1995.</p>
</text>
